Second gear!

343
00:19:56,860 --> 00:19:58,620
He's moving too fast.

344
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:06,400
We'll finish this another time, Kay. What?

345
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:09,437
I'd rather fight you when you
can use all your strength.

346
00:20:09,520 --> 00:20:10,873
It's more fun that way.

347
00:20:11,020 --> 00:20:12,255
I don't need charity.

348
00:20:12,620 --> 00:20:13,737
We fight now!

349
00:20:13,820 --> 00:20:15,780
Goodbye, Smokey!

350
00:20:16,100 --> 00:20:16,940
See ya!

351
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:19,140
And go Radical Bee!

352
00:20:28,760 --> 00:20:30,657
