401
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:18,717
Stay back we haven't seen if
it likes fire yet have we?

402
00:23:18,800 --> 00:23:20,840
I say we give it a try.

403
00:23:26,760 --> 00:23:29,797
There's nothing in the world
that's not afraid of fire.

404
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:33,500
Good idea smart gun the sucker.

405
00:23:37,700 --> 00:23:39,977
I'm gonna kill this slime monster.

406
00:23:40,060 --> 00:23:41,377
Won't be long now.

407
00:23:41,460 --> 00:23:43,257
