409
00:24:05,580 --> 00:24:07,140
No, damn you!

410
00:24:17,100 --> 00:24:19,580
So, anyone know what that thing is?

411
00:24:19,800 --> 00:24:22,340
Some kind of slimy blob monster.

412
00:24:22,540 --> 00:24:25,658
Touch it and spears boys
and burn it and it explodes.

413
