414
00:24:27,380 --> 00:24:29,439
Or was it alive in the first place?

415
00:24:29,740 --> 00:24:30,640
Doesn't matter.

416
00:24:31,320 --> 00:24:33,960
It's gone now, right? Yeah. Right.

417
00:24:34,300 --> 00:24:35,300
That's good, huh?

418
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:36,322
More than good.

419
00:24:36,700 --> 00:24:39,137
That explosion saved
us the trouble of going

420
00:24:39,220 --> 00:24:41,749
after the navy bastards
who stole our ship.

421
00:24:41,860 --> 00:24:43,080
It did us a favor.

422
