Good boy, I'm sorry I had to keep
you locked up for three years.

434
00:25:39,180 --> 00:25:42,840
Master, you should go sir,
it isn't safe here now?

435
00:25:51,500 --> 00:25:52,800
Just like I thought.

436
00:25:53,020 --> 00:25:54,480
It is Caesar Clown.

437
00:25:54,680 --> 00:25:56,260
He's the one behind this.

438
00:25:56,580 --> 00:25:57,820
Are you the master?

439
00:25:58,100 --> 00:25:58,980
That's it!

440
00:25:59,100 --> 00:26:00,159
You're going down!

441
00:26:01,840 --> 00:26:03,700
Master of Punk Hazard!

442
00:26:04,120 --> 00:26:08,480
Straw Hat Pirates and Marines of
the Navy G5, welcome to my island!

443
00:26:08,820 --> 00:26:12,160
Allow me to present the most
brilliant scientist ever!

444
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:18,600
I am Caesar Clown!

445
00:26:24,840 --> 00:26:28,120
A bit of patience, it won't be long.

446
00:26:30,540 --> 00:26:33,480
He doesn't tolerate
water very well, you see.

447
00:26:33,800 --> 00:26:38,740
So in order to cross the lake, he has
to fling himself over piece by piece.

448
00:26:39,460 --> 00:26:42,342
Inconvenient, perhaps,
but effective nonetheless.

449
00:26:44,360 --> 00:26:49,177
From a land of blazing fire
to a land of sparkling ice.

450
00:26:49,260 --> 00:26:53,495
In a few minutes, he will be fully
reassembled on this side of the lake.

451
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:59,560
And then, boys and girls,
the show will begin!

452
00:27:00,040 --> 00:27:05,460
A recreation of the explosion from four
years ago, and you have front row seats!

453
00:27:06,280 --> 00:27:10,760
Now, prepare for destruction on a scale
that you've never witnessed before!

454
00:27:15,360 --> 00:27:20,077
So is it uh living i have
no clue i've never seen

455
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:22,517
anything like it this is
such a shocking sight?

456
00:27:22,600 --> 00:27:24,177
My eyes might pop out of my head

457
00:27:24,260 --> 00:27:29,797
no they won't but i haven't got any

458
00:27:29,880 --> 00:27:35,237
Well whatever it is it's strange

459
00:27:35,320 --> 00:27:37,900
whatever it's doing is even stranger!

460
00:27:57,940 --> 00:28:00,060
I got you now, Master!
